<title>TURKEY: Turkey's Tupras sells 21,000 T HVGO to Glencore.</title>
<headline>Turkey's Tupras sells 21,000 T HVGO to Glencore.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's state oil refinery Tupras said it had sold 19,000 to 21,000 tonnes of heavy vacuum gas oil to Glencore-London through a tender at a premium of $16.8 per tonne.</p>
<p>It said the shipment would be from Izmir between March 23 and 25. The tender was held on March 6.</p>
<p>--Ankara Newsroom, 90-312-4462940</p>
